**Patent claim language:**

> wherein the polypropylene has:  
> (i) a melt flow rate of from 1.0 to 10 g/10 min, inclusive, measured at 230°C under a load of 2.16 kg;  
> (ii) a deflection temperature under load of at least 85°C, measured at an applied stress of 0.45 MPa;  
> (iii) a weight-average molecular weight (Mw) of from 200,000 to 450,000, inclusive, as determined by gel permeation chromatography; and  
> (iv) a molecular-weight distribution, expressed as the ratio of the weight-average molecular weight to the number-average molecular weight (Mw/Mn), of from 2 to 6, inclusive.
